  "title": "Jack-o&#39;-Lantern Stuffed Peppers",
  "description": "In this recipe, orange bell peppers are stuffed with a meat, cheese, and rice mixture and looks just like scary little Jack-o&#39;-lanterns in this fun dish.",
  "authors": [
