  "ingredients": [
    "1 teaspoon olive oil",
    "4 large orange bell peppers",
    "1 pound ground beef",
    "1 cup cooked rice",
    "1 cup grated sharp Cheddar cheese",
    "0.333 cup thinly sliced green onions",
    "2 tablespoons salted butter, melted",
    "2 tablespoons ketchup",
    "3 cloves garlic, minced",
    "2 teaspoons kosher salt",
    "1 teaspoon Worcestershire Sauce",
    "0.5 teaspoon ground black pepper",
    "3 pinches cayenne pepper, or to taste",
    "2 cups seasoned tomato sauce, warmed"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients. Preheat the oven to 400 degrees F (200 degrees C) with oven rack in upper position. Coat a baking dish with olive oil.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/EGS1q6tsNGq5teFoDaJMfepmtiw=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-recipe-8284459-jack-o-lantern-stuffed-peppers-step-01-d2c8449208504908826b6aab6c89af0b.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8284459/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cut eyes, nose, and mouth into flattest side of each pepper, just like a jack-o'-lantern, using a small knife. Cut around seed pods and remove tops, trimming and discarding any seeds from under the stems. Trim white membranes from inside each pepper; shake out any seeds. Place peppers in the prepared baking dish.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/4VSjHEwuzA7cpanKDIZ5WsvoTmk=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-recipe-8284459-jack-o-lantern-stuffed-peppers-step-02-6d8087b6c3d340c8b7113e52a4893bde.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8284459/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Combine ground beef, cooked rice, Cheddar cheese, green onions, melted butter, ketchup, garlic, salt, Worcestershire sauce, black pepper, and cayenne pepper in a bowl.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/PmtxoCahx0AYdjUQVyPWhjEd0E8=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-recipe-8284459-jack-o-lantern-stuffed-peppers-step-03-B-ceff5f04b37b4737a93d3fc1bd29432b.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8284459/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Divide and stuff beef mixture into peppers; cover with reserved pepper tops.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/jWLp8pz6UcVEe3gSNzD3ECFjyMU=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-recipe-8284459-jack-o-lantern-stuffed-peppers-step-04-05f94e1698ae4bab90f1984599ff06a2.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8284459/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Wrap baking dish loosely with aluminum foil; place on a baking sheet.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/d7bMg-iNE90QpJ8MK_HZPYqit4E=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-recipe-8284459-jack-o-lantern-stuffed-peppers-step-05-55c1cbe7aeca45349ae01afb919080dd.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8284459/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake in the preheated oven for 1 hour. Remove foil; continue baking until peppers are tender and ground beef is cooked through, 10 to 15 minutes more.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/Dsk0yXbw_MQ70j4OTDcjrKprkmg=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-recipe-8284459-jack-o-lantern-stuffed-peppers-step-06-f40a5d72471b48aba5805ab58c3ebd40.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8284459/step_06.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Place about 3 tablespoons warm tomato sauce on each plate; place stuffed peppers on top. Serve remaining sauce on the side.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/HL0chVx3ClfgkqbMVdjNy4_2Cwk=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-recipe-8284459-jack-o-lantern-stuffed-peppers-step-07-ce3465ab86aa4ecdaecd59db0d371725.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8284459/step_07.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Serve and enjoy!",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/uW86O75fE0mZR9-O5MErPWkp3b0=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-recipe-8284459-jack-o-lantern-stuffed-peppers-01-4x3-13b0480dc60346cf94c52899730079d4.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8284459/step_08.webp"
    }
