    "description": "Ring in the fall season with this easy and kid-friendly stuffed pepper recipe. In this video, Chef John makes jack-o-lantern stuffed peppers with a seasoned ground beef mixture. Similar to pumpkin carving, you’ll start by cutting a face into the side of the bell pepper before clearing out the the seeds and white membrane. Make the pepper’s stuffing by seasoning lean ground beef with salt, pepper, and cayenne as well as adding other ingredients like garlic and green onions. Add the mixture to the peppers and bake them in the oven for an hour. These spooky and simple stuffed peppers will be a hit at your Halloween party!",
